  "decision_conditions": [
    "Due to the submission of inconsistent and contradictory plans with regards to the location of  the proposed air source heat pump together with the absence of an appropriate noise assessment for the proposal, Officers are unable to fully assess the impact of the proposed development on the amenities of occupiers of the neighbouring properties and immediate surrounding area.  It is not evident from the planning application submission that the current proposal  would be compliant with the requirements of a standard noise condition or be considered for appropriate mitigation measures. \r\rThe applicant has therefore failed to demonstrate, through the submission of cogent information, that the proposed development would not have an unacceptable adverse impact on the amenities of occupiers of neighbouring properties  in conflict with Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021) and Policies CSS8  and DM10 of the Core Strategy ."
